  fishName: "K\xF6pekbal\u0131\u011F\u0131"
  fishDescription: "Okyanusun en g\xFC\xE7l\xFC avc\u0131s\u0131! Tam 300 di\u015F
    s\u0131ras\u0131 var ve d\xFC\u015Fen di\u015Flerin yerine yenileri \xE7\u0131kar!\n\n6
    metre uzunlu\u011Funda olabilir, bir araba kadar uzun!\n\nT\xFCm okyanuslarda
    ya\u015Far ama \u0131l\u0131k sular\u0131 sever.\n\n400 milyon y\u0131ld\u0131r
    d\xFCnyada ya\u015F\u0131yor, dinozorlardan bile eski!"
  fishAudio: {fileID: 0}
